  The reel_script says the 14 books were 'அகற்றப்பட்டுள்ளன' and the caption says 'அகற்றப்பட்டு' and that they were 'கட்டி வைக்கப்பட்டு' – the article says the books were tied up and sent, which is fine, but the draft's wording 'இருந்த 14 புத்தகங்கள்' and 'ஆத்தூரில் இருந்தது' is a loose rendering; more importantly the caption and script state the books were 'removed from the library' (அகற்றப்பட்டன) while the article's headline term 'அகற்றம்' refers to removal/withdrawal from the branch, so the phrasing is acceptable.
